        70.86609649658203,
        112.98261260986328,
        527.10009765625,
        127.42561340332031
      ],
      "text": "The risk of incident TB in the placebo group was expected to be 3% during the follow-up period, with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989395141601562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        126.18262481689453,
        527.4630126953125,
        140.62562561035156
      ],
      "text": "an expected reduction in incident TB with Lfx by 70% in the treatment group, based on estimates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.3826446533203,
        527.4419555664062,
        153.8256378173828
      ],
      "text": "of isoniazid efficacy in DS-TB. The sample size was increased to allow for 17% FQ resistance among",
