      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        165.7826690673828,
        527.4443969726562,
        180.2256622314453
      ],
      "text": "level and 1.07 at household level. To determine superiority, the required sample size was 1003 per",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        178.98268127441406,
        527.4301147460938,
        193.42567443847656
      ],
      "text": "arm on the basis of a two-sided alpha level of 0.05 and a power of 80%, allowing for clustering at",
