      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        268.42510986328125,
        527.4298706054688,
        282.8681335449219
      ],
      "text": "were also performed on the secondary (composite) outcomes of bacteriologically confirmed or",
